{
  "key": 8249,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0840_C02R0501_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m going to be a Sailor like my\n",
        "daddy!\r",
        "He’s a real man among men!\n",
        "Even the sea doesn’t scare him!\r",
        "Oh, but a Gym Leader’d be cool, too!\n",
        "Byron is so awesome!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0840_C02R0501_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "The little boy is thrashing about\n",
        "in his sleep.\r",
        "He appears to be in torment...\n",
        "He is muttering something...\r",
        "“DAR...\n",
        "DARK...is watching...me...”"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0840_C02R0501_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "The little boy is thrashing about\n",
        "in his sleep.\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}’s Lunar Wing began\n",
        "to glow...\r",
        "The boy’s sleeping face became\n",
        "untroubled and serene!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0840_C02R0501_00003",
      "en_US": "The little boy woke up!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0840_C02R0501_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "I couldn’t wake up...\n",
        "I saw it...\r",
        "It was a scary dream...\n",
        "It was a dark place...\\fAnd there was a dark Pokémon...\r",
        "But, Daddy, Mommy...\n",
        "I could always hear your voices..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0840_C02R0501_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, my gosh!\n",
        "You’re awake!\r",
        "Oh, my son...\n",
        "I... I don’t know what to say...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0840_C02R0501_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "Thank you!\n",
        "We’ll never forget you!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0840_C02R0501_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "Seeing you back to normal makes\n",
        "me feel great!\r",
        "I’ve regained my spirit as a Sailor!\n",
        "Come sail with me later!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0840_C02R0501_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "Our boy has too much energy!\n",
        "I wish he’d be a little quieter."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0840_C02R0501_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "I never thought our boy would fall\n",
        "into this endless nightmare...\r",
        "It’s happened in the past in\n",
        "Canalave...\r",
        "There were people who never woke\n",
        "up from their nightmares..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0840_C02R0501_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "Thank you! We can’t thank you\n",
        "enough, but thank you!"
      ]
    }
  ]
}